pets:Stevie a pets:Cat ;
    rdfs:label "Stevie" ;
    rdfs:comment "A specific female cat, five years old, with a cow-cat (black-and-white bicolor) pattern. Extremely shy with strangers. Energetic and playful. She loves her feather wand and drags it to a person when she wants to play. She loves Temptations treats and Aussie wet food. Fleece is her favorite fabric; she is more inclined to be affectionate if a fleece blanket or robe is handy." ;
