pets:Lilo a pets:Cat ;
    rdfs:label "Lilo" ;
    rdfs:comment "A specific female calico cat, around ten years old. Strongly motivated by chicken and Aussie wet food; wet food is her primary affection motivation. Not strongly motivated by Temptations but will accept them. Prefers to sit awkwardly at a distance and head-bonks when she wants pets. Warm-up to strangers is under an hour." ;
