pets:Q a pets:Rabbit, pets:DutchRabbit ;
    rdfs:label "Q" ;
    rdfs:comment "A specific 3-year-old male Dutch rabbit. Confident but nervous and shy at first. Does not love being touched unless he invited it. When he wants pets he flops nearby or loafs, makes eye contact, and chitters his teeth. Loves treats and dry food. Loves a sunny windowsill. Not a big fan of stairs. Sometimes upset when Jules blocks him from eating or steals his treats." ;
