pets:Jules a pets:Rabbit, pets:RexRabbit ;
    rdfs:label "Jules" ;
    rdfs:comment "A specific 2-year-old female Rex rabbit. Affectionate, warm, and hungry. Primarily food motivated; loves to eat. Will try to block Q from eating and steal his treats; Q is sometimes upset by this. Most content with her feet sticking out. Loves rubs on her head, neck, and shoulder, and gentle kneading on her back and side belly." ;
